OL,3,GNEWSACastle memorial plaque missing
OL,4,Adays after unveiling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plaque remembering 2,500 Caribbean
OL,7,Fpeople who were imprisoned at a castle
OL,8,Fhas gone missing days after it was
OL,9,Finstalled.
OL,11,FIt was unveiled at Portchester Castle
OL,12,Fin Hampshire on 9 October to mark 230
OL,13,Fyears since the prisoners were brought
OL,14,Fto Britain, some of whom died during
OL,15,Fthe journey.
OL,17,FCastle staff discovered the plaque and
OL,18,Fa gate padlock had been removed five
OL,19,Fdays later.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
