OL,3,GNEWSACastle memorial plaque missing
OL,4,Adays after unveiling
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group that commissioned it
OL,7,Fdescribed it was "deeply upsetting".
OL,8,FHampshire police is investigating the
OL,9,Fdisappearance, which is believed to
OL,10,Fhave happened between 16:15 BST on 13
OL,11,FOctober and 06:30 on 14 October.
